Ebipụtabeghị ọrụ nyocha ọ bụla.","No points earned yet — be the first!":"Onye ọ bụla enwebeghị isi — bụrụ onye mbụ!","See leaderboard →":"Lee tebụl ndị na-eduga →","Self-directed courses":"Usoro ọmụmụ i hazịrị n'onwe gị","Learnza account":"Akaụntụ Learnza","Programme":"Mmemme ọmụmụ","+ New group":"+ Otu ọhụrụ","0 days":"Ụbọchị 0","days to exam":"ụbọchị ruo ule","weak areas":"ebe adịghị ike","study/day":"ọmụmụ/ụbọchị","to exam (estimate)":"ruo ule (atụmatụ)","to cover":"ịkpuchi","Generated for":"Emepụtara maka","Wednesday — Today":"Wenezde — Taa","Sunday — Today":"Sọnde — Taa","Monday — Today":"Mọnde — Taa","Tuesday — Today":"Tuzde — Taa","Thursday — Today":"Tọzde — Taa","Friday — Today":"Fraịde — Taa","Saturday — Today":"Satọde — Taa","⏰ Now":"⏰ Ugbu a","read and revise":"gụọ ma lelee","THU":"TỌZ","FRI":"FRA","SAT":"SAT","SUN":"SỌN","MON":"MỌN","TUE":"TUZ","WED":"WEN","TODAY":"TAA","Section A (30 objective questions) and":"Ngalaba A (ajụjụ nhọrọ 30) na","Choose a course, then the year of the paper. Every paper has":"Họrọ usoro ọmụmụ, mgbe ahụ afọ akwụkwọ ule. Akwụkwọ ule ọ bụla nwere","(30 objective questions) and":"(ajụjụ nhọrọ 30) na","(5 theory questions), set the way your kind of institution sets its examinations.":"(ajụjụ edemede 5), edoziri dịka ụdị ụlọ akwụkwọ gị si edozi ule ya.","The pre-recorded lectures the system's Learnza Lecturer made for each of your courses: the same ones listed inside the course. This is where you carry on learning when your live Learnza minutes or coins run out. Classes you took live are under":"Ihe ọmụmụ onye nkụzi Learnza nke sistemụ dere maka usoro ọmụmụ gị ọ bụla: otu ihe ahụ edepụtara n'ime usoro ọmụmụ ahụ. Ebe a ka ị ga-aga n'ihu na-amụ mgbe nkeji Learnza ma ọ bụ mkpụrụ ego gị gwụrụ. Klaasị ị gara n'ụzọ ndụ nọ n'okpuru","The live classes the Learnza Lecturer taught you, recorded as they happened. Watch a class again, pick it up where you stopped, or download its notes. Lectures the system recorded in advance are under":"Klaasị ndụ onye nkụzi Learnza kụziri gị, edeburu ka ha na-eme. Lee klaasị ọzọ, gaa n'ihu ebe ị kwụsịrị, ma ọ bụ budata ndetu ya. Ihe ọmụmụ sistemụ dere na mbụ nọ n'okpuru","You have not taken a live class with the Learnza Lecturer yet. Open a course and tap":"Ị gabeghị klaasị ndụ na onye nkụzi Learnza. Mepee usoro ọmụmụ pịa","Testing phase: every feature is free for everyone right now, subscribed or not. Pricing below is what it'll cost once testing wraps up.":"Oge nnwale: a na-enye ihe niile n'efu nye onye ọ bụla ugbu a, ọ bụrụ na ọ debanyela aha ma ọ bụ ọ debanyeghị. Ọnụahịa dị n'okpuru bụ ihe ọ ga-efu mgbe nnwale gwụchara.","Subscribe to unlock Learnza Lecturer lectures, recorded lectures and live classes — each plan includes a bank of live Learnza Lecturer minutes (300/month, or 3,600 for the year) that refills every time you subscribe. e-Library, study groups and CBT practice stay free either way.":"Debanye aha iji meghee ihe ọmụmụ onye nkụzi Learnza, ihe ọmụmụ edeburu na klaasị ndụ — atụmatụ ọ bụla nwere nkeji onye nkụzi Learnza ndụ (300 kwa ọnwa, ma ọ bụ 3,600 kwa afọ) nke na-agbakwunye ugboro ọ bụla ị debanyere aha. Ụlọ akwụkwọ ịntanetị, otu ọmụmụ na omume CBT na-anọgide n'efu n'ụzọ abụọ.","Your subscription already includes Learnza Lecturer minutes each cycle. Coins are used only after those run out, so":"Ndebanye aha gị nwere nkeji onye nkụzi Learnza n'oge ọ bụla. A na-eji mkpụrụ ego mgbe ndị ahụ gwụchara, ya mere","{n} minutes of live Learnza Lecturer time in your wallet (1 coin = 1 minute)":"nkeji {n} nke oge onye nkụzi Learnza ndụ dị na obere akpa gị (mkpụrụ ego 1 = nkeji 1)","{n} minute of live Learnza Lecturer time in your wallet (1 coin = 1 minute)":"nkeji {n} nke oge onye nkụzi Learnza ndụ dị na obere akpa gị (mkpụrụ ego 1 = nkeji 1)","{n} minutes of live Learnza teaching · {0}":"nkeji {n} nke nkuzi Learnza ndụ · {0}","{n} minutes — best value · {0}":"nkeji {n} — uru kacha mma · {0}","{n} days":"ụbọchị {n}","{n} day":"ụbọchị {n}","{n} hrs":"awa {n}","{n}